# =============================================================================
# MedicoMatch — Vercel frontend (SPA build-time config).
# Paste into the Vercel project (Settings -> Environment Variables) for the
# Production environment, one row each. Rebuild + redeploy after any change.
#
# The SPA is static output (npm run build -> dist/). Ship as a plain static
# deployment — NO serverless functions, NO rewrites to the API. The Express
# backend stays on Railway (see server/railway.json + DEPLOYMENT.md); split
# origin is supported out of the box (credentials: "include" + CORS origins).
#
# Fill-in checklist:
#   [ ] VITE_API_BASE_URL: the Railway public domain, e.g.
#       https://medicomatch-api.up.railway.app (no trailing slash).
#       Your Railway domain must ALSO be in backend APP_URL/CORS_ORIGINS.
#   [ ] VITE_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID: the LIVE publishable key (matches the backend
#       RAZORPAY_KEY_ID). Never the secret.
#   [ ] VITE_SUPPORT_EMAIL / feature flags to taste.
# =============================================================================

VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://medicomatch-api.up.railway.app
VITE_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
VITE_DEV_SKIP_AUTH=false
VITE_SUPPORT_EMAIL=support@medicomatch.in
VITE_ASTROLOGY_ENABLED=false
